{"id": "69857", "title": "教官，不可以", "author": "韩脉脉", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 9, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69857.htm", "intro": "如果时间可以倒流，初三的小萝莉程果依然会去勾搭西大的校草徐慕斯，\r\n就像五年后，徐教官不择手段地勾搭程系花。\r\n雅痞空军少校VS腹黑小美女，教官，不可以！\r\n爱，教会我们从一而终。\r\n\r\n程果向后退了一步，“不好玩，我不想玩了。” \r\n徐慕斯探过身子低头在她耳边轻轻开口，“晚了，由不得你。”古人云，玩火者必自焚。\r\n内容标签：军旅 高干 情有独钟 都市情缘", "base": "files/article/html/69/69857", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10711802.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10711803.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10711804.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10711805.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-37", "file": "10711806.html", "available": false}, {"title": "38-43", "file": "10711807.html", "available": false}, {"title": "44-48", "file": "10711808.html", "available": false}, {"title": "49-54", "file": "10711809.html", "available": false}, {"title": "55-57完结", "file": "10711810.html", "available": false}]}